//real-user-reported follow-up to #653's teventStubs batch - deliberately independent from
//p_bleeding_effect (the thief ability's own def) per the user's explicit choice. MaxTicks=10
//mirrors the real archive's own "more1h=10 //opakovani krvaceni maximalne" (max repeats)
//literally; TickInterval=2 is faster than the player ability's 5s (a natural bite bleeding
//out quicker feels right for a monster attack, not gated behind a trained skill); MaxPower=150
//gives real headroom above a typical single-hit contribution (actualDamage/3, so a 60-damage
//bite contributes 20) without being an effectively uncapped stack.
[NpcBleedEffectPluginDef p_npc_bleed_effect]
TickInterval = 2
MaxTicks = 10
MaxPower = 150
PluginKey = @@npc_bleed
